# Exercise 7: NOT
#
# NOT p(x) is true when Sova can't prove p(x):
#
#     rule quiet(x):
#         person(x)
#         AND NOT talks(x)
#
# Like a comparison, NOT needs its values first: "NOT talks(x)" with x
# unknown doesn't say who. So find x with another goal before the NOT.
#
# Your task: write can_join(x): x is a person who is not banned.

fact person("Ana")
fact person("Ben")
fact person("Cy")
fact banned("Ben")

# Write your rule below this line.



# --- Checks: run ./sova --check on this file. Don't change below here. ---
hint "Two goals: first person(x), then NOT banned(x)."
hint "If you put NOT first, Sova will say x has no value yet."
expect can_join("Ana")
expect NOT can_join("Ben")
expect NOT can_join("Zed")
expect can_join(who) gives "Ana", "Cy"
